<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Mika Flowers and the Open Learning Notebook.">
  <section>
    <p class="kicker">about this notebook</p>
    <h2>Hi, I'm Mika.</h2>
    <p>I build small Linux things and write down what I learn while making them. This site is both my open learning journal and my personal writing home.</p>
    <p>The field notes are the messy middle: bugs I traced, concepts that clicked, systems I misunderstood, and mental models I want to keep. Writing is where some of those threads become longer essays and articles.</p>
    <p>The goal is not to pretend I know everything. It's to leave a useful trail of what I tried, what broke, what worked, and what I learned next.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/miflow13">github.com/miflow13</a> · <a href="https://dev.to/mikachu">DEV Community ↗</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
